// A rope ladder tied on the lip of a 7.5 m cliff. Standing on the ledge beside its head, S takes the mole onto
// the rope (it doesn't dig the ledge it's tied to) and climbs down at 3.5 m/s. Climbing down isn't falling:
// the mole reaches the floor with no fall damage (a 7.5 m drop would cost 30 hp).
map
